---
import Site from '../layouts/Site.astro';
---

<Site
  title="Your feed, your choices"
  description="Explore user-controlled feed category filtering with a free, synthetic demonstration."
>
  <h1>Your feed, your choices.</h1>
  <p class="lead">
    Keep the opportunities. Make room for useful ideas. Choose which kinds of
    posts you want to see, and reveal anything you hide.
  </p>
  <p>
    <a class="button" href="/demo/">
      Try the synthetic demo
    </a>
  </p>
  <p>
    No key, account or provider request. Fixed examples show how your choices
    work.
  </p>
  <h2>A preference, not a verdict</h2>
  <p>
    ClearedIn is a development project for reversible category filtering on the
    desktop LinkedIn home feed. It does not judge authors or detect AI-generated
    writing.
  </p>
  <h2>Choose what matters</h2>
  <p>
    Hide engagement bait, protect job postings, or leave everything visible. A
    post can belong to more than one category: Always show takes precedence.
  </p>
  <div class="notice">
    <strong>Public release is pending.</strong>
    <p>
      Browser and provider validation, independent evaluation and a
      platform/distribution decision are still required.{' '}
      <a href="/install/">See installation status</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</Site>
